 of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1444459231085650", "version": "0.2.345"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1444459231085650"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "tons of small updates", "created_date": 1794064549, "id": "1444459231085650", "version": "0.2.345", "version_code": 345, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1444459231085650"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Shadows now start off, to stop strips of clay going missing in the left eye on Quest 3 and 3S.\r\n- If you turned Shadows on yourself and see those gaps, turn them off in Preferences. We're still working on the cause.", "created_date": 1793986033, "id": "1443572261174347", "version": "0.2.339", "version_code": 339, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1444459231085650"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "mirror bug and poly bug", "created_date": 1793904529, "id": "1442603881271185", "version": "0.2.338", "version_code": 338, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1444459231085650"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Huge-brush freeze: the first frame of a very big brush no longer copies the undo buffer three times. In the desktop test it now makes 0 copies, and undo still restores the clay exactly. That copying caused the 500 ms freeze on your 300 mm brush.\r\nSave freeze, partly: the two shaders behind the 972 ms freeze now compile at startup. That doesn\u2019t explain the 722 ms the main thread was blocked, so the save may still hitch. The next log should show how much is left.", "created_date": 1793832241, "id": "1441766694688237", "version": "0.2.337", "version_code": 337, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1444459231085650"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "Visuals and lag, ready for 0.2.333:\r\n\r\nEdges in videos and photos: I checked your real recordings, and the clay outlines were stair-stepped. Videos and photos now get an anti-aliasing pass (FXAA) that only touches edges, once per frame or photo. It doesn\u2019t affect what you see in the headset.\r\nIn tests, 2.9\u00d7 more video edge pixels and 1.7\u00d7 more photo edge pixels now land between clay and background, and no pixel inside the clay changed.\r\nVideo colours: your videos carried no colour-space tag, so some players guess wrong and shift greens and reds. New videos are tagged. I can\u2019t test this on the PC, so I\u2019ll check your next recording.\r\nLighter clay on every headset: the clay is limited by per-pixel shading, so I moved the ambient lighting to per-vertex. The picture is unchanged: the four Looks match 0.2.332 to within 1 colour level.\r\nThe speed gain still has to be measured on the headset. The headset benchmark now has a matching phase that times the old per-pixel version against the new one in the same run.\r\nSky backdrop: it showed visible banding (stripes across the gradient) on the headset\u2019s 8-bit display. A tiny fixed dither removes them. Sky is the default backdrop on Quest 2.", "created_date": 1793761042, "id": "1440915281440045", "version": "0.2.333", "version_code": 333, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}